# Gold Layer - Data Dictionary

The Gold layer provides business-ready data for analytics and reporting
using a Star Schema design.

## Gold Objects

| Object | Type | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `gold.dim_customer` | Dimension | Customer attributes |
| `gold.dim_products` | Dimension | Current product attributes |
| `gold.fact_sales` | Fact | Sales transactions and measures |

## `gold.dim_customer`

| Column | Description |
|---|---|
| `customer_key` | Surrogate customer key |
| `customer_id` | Source customer ID |
| `customer_number` | Business customer key |
| `first_name` | Customer first name |
| `last_name` | Customer last name |
| `country` | Customer country |
| `marital_status` | Customer marital status |
| `gender` | Standardized customer gender |
| `birthdate` | Customer birth date |
| `create_date` | Customer creation date |

## `gold.dim_products`

| Column | Description |
|---|---|
| `product_key` | Surrogate product key |
| `product_id` | Source product ID |
| `product_number` | Business product key |
| `product_name` | Product name |
| `category_id` | Product category ID |
| `category` | Product category |
| `subcategory` | Product subcategory |
| `maintenance` | Maintenance classification |
| `product_cost` | Product cost |
| `product_line` | Product line |
| `start_date` | Product start date |

## `gold.fact_sales`

| Column | Description |
|---|---|
| `order_number` | Sales order number |
| `product_key` | Foreign key to `dim_products` |
| `customer_key` | Foreign key to `dim_customer` |
| `order_date` | Order date |
| `shipping_date` | Shipping date |
| `due_date` | Due date |
| `sales_amount` | Sales amount |
| `quantity` | Quantity sold |
| `price` | Unit price |

